{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fantasy real-time tactics simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506670/extras/0.gif?t=1745447542\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real-time Action Tactical Simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle utilizing tactical elements such as suppression and cover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various strategies through combinations of units and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story unfolds in a world where guns and magic coexist</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay driven by tactical elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506670/extras/1-2.png?t=1745447542\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form a squad of 4 units and go into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To win, you must create tactically advantageous conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seize a position that is advantageous for your units to take cover, but disadvantageous for the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your unit's skills in the most effective situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make tactical judgments and give orders at every moment, such as attacking, defending, and retreating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3506670?t=1745447542","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3506670?t=1745447542","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506670/54648aa708350bb5a6f9a244346460ca1de442a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745447542","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506670/54648aa708350bb5a6f9a244346460ca1de442a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745447542","categories":[{"d